OL,3,GNEWSAFirst results declared Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnchan has been the first constituency
OL,7,Fto declare elected candidates in the
OL,8,F2026 general election, followed closely
OL,9,Fby Douglas South.
OL,11,FOnchan has elected scientist Rachel
OL,12,FGlover and Rob Callister keeps his
OL,13,Fseat, meaning that former education
OL,14,Fminister Julie Edge has not been
OL,15,Fre-elected.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, both Sarah Maltby and Claire
OL,18,FChristian keep their seats in the first
OL,19,Fof the four constituencies in the
OL,20,Fcapital to vote.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
